# Every text file in this repo is stored with LF endings, whatever the
# checkout platform does locally. Tooling that parses file content is
# otherwise CRLF-sensitive, and a checker that mis-parses fails open:
# check-prerequisites.mjs once read 9 of 125 modules on a Windows clone,
# found nothing wrong, and exited zero. See issue #26.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, left alone.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
